      "comment": "GRANDIOSE GIRL (4) has a strong record this track and trip with three wins and three placings from eight starts. Comes off a (16.56) win last time, scoring by 4.5 lengths in a Grade 5 over 300m at this track. Expected to be in the finish. COAL CRUSHER (2) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by a neck at this track in a handy 16.78 beating Milo Davis. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Should be in this for a long way. SMOOTH SUPREME (7) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a Grade 5 at this track over 300m.",
